### Generated Xcode project (single source of truth is project.yml).
### Only the shared schemes are tracked: Xcode Cloud scans the repo for
### them at workflow-creation time, before ci_post_clone.sh can generate
### anything. Re-commit them whenever project.yml targets/schemes change.
ios/TimeOfLife/TimeOfLife.xcodeproj/*
!ios/TimeOfLife/TimeOfLife.xcodeproj/xcshareddata
ios/TimeOfLife/TimeOfLife.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/*
!ios/TimeOfLife/TimeOfLife.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/xcschemes
ios/TimeOfLife/TimeOfLife.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/xcschemes/*
!ios/TimeOfLife/TimeOfLife.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/xcschemes/*.xcscheme

